**Claim**: `graph(GraphFunction)` is the built-in data visualization element; it renders using text/block characters and can be used without color.

**Evidence** ([elements.hpp](https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/FTXUI/blob/a9ddb312f9b00dd492ba73b5394a72c601ef2c94/include/ftxui/dom/elements.hpp#L100-L104)):

```cpp
